<title>USA: ICT Group Inc Q1 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>ICT Group Inc Q1 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LANGHORNE, Pa. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p> NET REVENUES				  $ 20,492	$ 16,220</p>
<p>OPERATING EXPENSES:</p>
<p>  Costs of services			    11,415	   8,767</p>
<p>  Selling, general and administrative     8,440	   6,796</p>
<p>						     19,855	  15,563</p>
<p>  Operating income				  637	     657</p>
<p> Interest expense (income), net	     (138)	     233</p>
<p>  Income before taxes			     775	     424</p>
<p> Pro forma provision for income taxes (A)   302	     170</p>
<p> Pro forma net income (A)			 473	     254</p>
<p> Pro forma earnings per share		  0.04	    0.03</p>
<p>Shares used in computing pro forma</p>
<p>  earnings per share			   12,185	   9,702</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>(A) A pro forma provision for taxes for periods prior to June 14, 1996, the effective date of the company's offering, has been computed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
